  "developerNotes": [
    "v57 live read: 331 open-system rows = 237 New / 61 Pending / 33 Reopen; New+Pending gate 298 (237 New / 61 Pending). Gate membership is set-compared against the persisted v56 snapshot rather than asserted.",
